
### ==================================
### TASKFLOW API - CRUD TESTLERİ
### ==================================

### 1. TÜM GÖREVLERİ LİSTELE (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks


### 2. YENİ GÖREV EKLE (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Bitirme Projesi Testi",
    "description": "TaskFlow API CRUD testleri yapılıyor",
    "priority": "high",
    "status": "pending",
    "assignee": "merve"
}


### 3. ID'YE GÖRE GÖREV GETİR (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1


### 4. GÖREV GÜNCELLE (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Güncellenmiş Görev Başlığı",
    "status": "completed",
    "priority": "medium"
}


### 5. GÖREV SİL (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/1


### 6. SİLİNEN GÖREVİ KONTROL ET (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
